@*EmployeeAvailabilityPanel.razor - komponente, kas ļauj redzēt un rediģēt konkrēta darbinieka pieejamību (atvaļinājumi, slimības lapas, brīvdienas) *@

@using ManaApp.Models
@using ManaApp.Components.PriorityTasks
@inject HttpClient Http
@inject IJSRuntime JS


<div class="ea-panel-container @(EmployeeId == null ? "ea-panel-empty" : "ea-panel-active")">

    <div class="ea-header">
        <div>
            @(EmployeeId != null 
                ? $"Pieejamība - {Employees.FirstOrDefault(x => x.Id == EmployeeId)?.Name}" 
                : "Pieejamība")
        </div>
        @if (EmployeeId != null)
                {
                    <button class="ea-btn-add"
                            @onclick="AddNew"
                            title="Pievienot jaunu ierakstu">
                        + 
                    </button>
                }
        </div>

@if (showForm && (newItem != null || editingItem != null))
{
<div class="ea-popup-overlay">
    <div class="ea-popup">
        <div class="ea-popup-header">
           <div style="flex:1; text-align:center;">
                @(Employees.FirstOrDefault(x => x.Id == EmployeeId)?.Name ?? "")
            </div>

            <button type="button"
                    class="ea-btn info"
                    title="Apskatīt piešķirtos darbus"
                    @onclick="ShowTasks">
                i
            </button>
        </div>
    @{
    var formItem = editingItem ?? newItem!;
        }
        <div class="ea-popup-body">
            <div class="ea-row-horizontal">
                <label>Veids:</label>

                <select @bind="formItem.Status" @bind:after="OnStatusChanged">
                    <option value="VACATION">Atvaļinājums</option>
                    <option value="SICK">Slimības lapa</option>
                    <option value="ABSENT">Brīvdiena</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="ea-row-horizontal">
                <label>Periods</label>


<div class="ea-date-row">

    <!-- FROM -->
    <div class="ea-date-wrap">
        <input type="date"
               class="ea-date-hidden"
               value="@formItem.DateFrom.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")"
               @onchange="e => formItem.DateFrom = DateTime.Parse(e.Value!.ToString()!)"
               @ref="dateFromRef" />

        <button type="button" class="ea-date-btn" @onclick="() => OpenDate(dateFromRef)">
            📅
        </button>

        <span class="ea-date-text">
            @formItem.DateFrom.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy")
        </span>
    </div>

    <span>-</span>

    <!-- TO -->
    <div class="ea-date-wrap">
        <input type="date"
               class="ea-date-hidden"
               value="@(formItem.DateTo?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd"))"
               @onchange="e => formItem.DateTo = string.IsNullOrEmpty(e.Value?.ToString()) ? null : DateTime.Parse(e.Value!.ToString()!)"
               @ref="dateToRef" />

        <button type="button" class="ea-date-btn" @onclick="() => OpenDate(dateToRef)">
            📅
        </button>

        <span class="ea-date-text">
            @(formItem.DateTo?.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy") ?? "—")
        </span>
    </div>

</div>
                </div>
            </div>


            <div class="ea-row">
                <label>Komentārs</label>
                <input type="text" @bind="formItem.Notes" />
            </div>

            <div class="ea-popup-footer">
                @if (editingItem != null && CanDelete(editingItem))
                    {
                        <button class="ea-btn delete"
                                title="Dzēst šo ierakstu"
                                @onclick="Delete">
                            Dzēst
                        </button>
                    }
                <button class="ea-btn save" @onclick="async () => await Save()">Saglabāt</button>
                <button class="ea-btn cancel" @onclick="() => CancelEdit()">Atcelt</button>
            </div>
        </div>
</div>
}

<div class="ea-list">

@if (EmployeeId != null)
{
    <div class="ea-list-header">
        <div>Veids</div>
        <div>No</div>
        <div>Līdz</div>
        <div>Komentārs</div>
        <div></div>
    </div>
}

    <div class="ea-list-body">
    @if (!filtered.Any())
        {
            <div class="ea-empty">Nav ierakstu</div>
        }

    @foreach (var item in filtered)
    {
        var isOld = item.DateTo != null && item.DateTo < DateTime.Today;

                <div class="ea-row-item @(isOld ? "ea-item-old" : "")">
                    <div>@GetStatusText(item.Status)</div>
                    <div>@item.DateFrom.ToShortDateString()</div>
                    <div>@(item.DateTo?.ToShortDateString() ?? "-")</div>
                    <div>@item.Notes</div>
                    <div>
                        <button class="ea-btn-edit" @onclick="() => StartEditFull(item)">
    ✎
</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
    }
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


@if (showTasksPopup && EmployeeId != null)
{
    <EmployeeLoadPopup
        EmployeeId="EmployeeId.Value"
        OnClose="() => showTasksPopup = false" />
}

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public int? EmployeeId { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public DateTime SelectedDate { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel> Availability { get; set; } = new();

    private List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel> filtered = new();
    EmployeeAvailabilityModel? newItem;
    bool showForm = false;
    int? editingItemId = null;
    DateTime? editingDateTo = null;
protected override void OnParametersSet()
{
    newItem = null;
    editingItem = null;
    showForm = false;
    editingItemId = null;
    editingDateTo = null;

    if (EmployeeId == null)
    {
        filtered = new();
        return;
    }

    filtered = Availability
        .Where(x => x.EmployeeID == EmployeeId)
        .OrderBy(x => x.DateTo != null && x.DateTo < DateTime.Today ? 1 : 0)
        .ThenByDescending(x => x.DateFrom)
        .ToList();
}

void AddNew()
{
newItem = new EmployeeAvailabilityModel
{
    EmployeeID = EmployeeId ?? 0,
    DateFrom = SelectedDate,
    Status = "VACATION",
    DateTo = null
};

    showForm = true;
    editingItem = null;
    editingItemId = null;
}

async Task SaveNew()
{
    if (newItem == null)
        return;

    if (newItem.DateFrom == default)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Norādi sākuma datumu");
        return;
    }

    if (newItem.Status != "SICK" && newItem.DateTo == null)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Norādi beigu datumu");
        return;
    }

    if (newItem.DateTo != null && newItem.DateTo < newItem.DateFrom)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Nepareizs datumu intervāls");
        return;
    }

    await Http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/employeeavailability", newItem);

    Availability = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel>>(
    "api/employeeavailability/range?from=2000-01-01&to=2100-01-01"
) ?? new();

    showForm = false;
    newItem = null;
    

    OnParametersSet();
}

void OnStatusChanged()
{
    if (newItem == null)
        return;

    if (newItem.Status == "SICK")
    {
        newItem.DateTo = null;
    }
}

void StartEdit(EmployeeAvailabilityModel item)
{
    editingItemId = item.ID;
    editingDateTo = DateTime.Today;
}

async Task SaveClose(EmployeeAvailabilityModel item)
{
if (editingDateTo == null)
    return;

if (editingDateTo < item.DateFrom)
{
    await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Beigu datums nevar būt pirms sākuma datuma");
    return;
}

item.DateTo = editingDateTo;

    await Http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/employeeavailability", item);

    Availability = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel>>(
        "api/employeeavailability/range?from=2000-01-01&to=2100-01-01"
    ) ?? new();

    editingItemId = null;
    editingDateTo = null;

    OnParametersSet();
}
void CancelEdit()
{
    editingItemId = null;
    editingDateTo = null;
    editingItem = null;
    newItem = null;
    showForm = false;
}

EmployeeAvailabilityModel? editingItem = null;

void StartEditFull(EmployeeAvailabilityModel item)
{
    if (item.DateTo != null && item.DateTo < DateTime.Today)
        return; // vecos neļaujam editēt

    editingItem = new EmployeeAvailabilityModel
    {
        ID = item.ID,
        EmployeeID = item.EmployeeID,
        DateFrom = item.DateFrom,
        DateTo = item.DateTo,
        Status = item.Status,
        Notes = item.Notes
    };

    newItem = null;
    showForm = true;
    editingItemId = null;
}

async Task Save()
{
    var item = editingItem ?? newItem;

    if (item == null)
        return;

    if (item.DateFrom == default)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Norādi sākuma datumu");
        return;
    }

    if (item.Status != "SICK" && item.DateTo == null)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Norādi beigu datumu");
        return;
    }

    if (item.DateTo != null && item.DateTo < item.DateFrom)
    {
        await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("alert", "Nepareizs datumu intervāls");
        return;
    }

    await Http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/employeeavailability", new
            {
                item.ID,
                item.EmployeeID,
                item.DateFrom,
                item.DateTo,
                item.Status,
                item.Notes,
                RemoveAssignedTasks = removeAssignedTasks
            });

    Availability = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel>>(
        "api/employeeavailability/range?from=2000-01-01&to=2100-01-01"
    ) ?? new();

    showForm = false;
    newItem = null;
    editingItem = null;

    OnParametersSet();
}

[Parameter]
public List<EmployeeDto> Employees { get; set; } = new();

bool removeAssignedTasks = false;

bool CanDelete(EmployeeAvailabilityModel item)
{
    return (DateTime.Today - item.DateFrom).TotalDays <= 5;
}

async Task Delete()
{
    if (editingItem == null)
        return;

    var confirm = await JS.InvokeAsync<bool>("confirm", "Vai dzēst ierakstu?");
    if (!confirm)
        return;

    await Http.DeleteAsync($"api/employeeavailability/{editingItem.ID}");

    Availability = await Http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<EmployeeAvailabilityModel>>(
        "api/employeeavailability/range?from=2000-01-01&to=2100-01-01"
    ) ?? new();

    showForm = false;
    editingItem = null;

    OnParametersSet();
}

bool showTasksPopup = false;
void ShowTasks()
{
    showTasksPopup = true;
}

private ElementReference dateFromRef;
private ElementReference dateToRef;

async Task OpenDate(ElementReference input)
{
    await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("openDatePicker", input);
}

async Task OnRemoveTasksChanged(ChangeEventArgs e)
{
    var newValue = (bool)e.Value!;

    if (newValue)
    {
        var confirm = await JS.InvokeAsync<bool>("confirm",
            "Vai tiešām noņemt visus piešķirtos darbus šim darbiniekam?");

        if (!confirm)
            return;
    }

    removeAssignedTasks = newValue;
}

string GetStatusText(string status)
{
    return status switch
    {
        "VACATION" => "Atvaļinājums",
        "SICK" => "Slimības lapa",
        "ABSENT" => "Brīvdiena",
        _ => status
    };
}

}